{
  "bookId": "hero-213109",
  "id": "bond-37904",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37904001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "新人，这段时间我和小奏就先在你这住下了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊……哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "这个反应有点冷淡呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37904005",
              "text": "啊……哦。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37904005",
              "text": "好耶！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37904004",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "接下来就带我看看你家里的环境吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "「战线」的发展也是需要场地的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这里是卧室。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "……还挺整洁的，现在身体变小了，衣柜里可以改造成作战本部。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是客厅。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "娱乐区域……或者说，运动区域吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……这是厨房。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "啊，设备还挺多的，武器装备什么的就在这里制造吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳……这是后宅。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "很多手办在这里生活呢，抽空招募一些新同伴吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有个问题，现在战线的对抗对象是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "答案是显而易见的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "让手办遭受不合理的待遇的对象，都是我们的敌人哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "百合等人的战斗仍将继续，敬请期待！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37904019",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仲村百合",
          "text": "不要模仿奇怪的背景解说啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
